        "page_index": 0,
        "reading_text": "AGENDA - Cedar Hollow Residents Committee\nVillage hall, main room - Thursday 11 March 2027, 19:00\n1. Welcome and apologies\n2. Minutes of the meeting held on 14 January 2027\n3. Matters arising: footpath lighting; notice board repairs\n4. Treasurer's report\n5. Grant request: youth football equipment\n6. Any other business\nChair: M. Aldana Secretary: P. Lindqvist\nNOTICES\nThe hall kitchen remains closed for repairs until further notice. Rubbish collection moves to Tuesday from the first\nweek of April. Contact the secretary to book the hall for private events.\nA refuse sack was left in the main room after the February meeting; the hall keeper asks that the last person out\nchecks the corners of the room.\nCedar Hollow Residents Committee - synthetic fixture Page 1 of 1",
